  "description": "⚒️ **Founded: 25-08-2024** ⚒️\n\n🌍 Timezone: GMT+2\n\n════════════════════════\n\n📩 **Applying**:\n\n- DISCORD IS REQUIRED\n- Combat LVL 50+\n- Guild Discord: DM pyrrhanikos2480 or desskit or chill_ac on discord.\n\n════════════════════════\n\n📖 **Guild Guidelines**:\n\n- Building up a community and helping each other is more important than playing the game - this is why we require discord.\n- We are a resilient guild with a semi-long history of ups and downs. We have survived so far and we aren&#039;t giving up. \n- Higher level players will handle challenges and marks, but not participating in raids or signs of prolonged inactivity leads to exclusion.\n\n\n════════════════════════\n\n⚔️ **Daily Guild Raids and Services**:\n\n- 18:00 GMT+2 (we&#039;re starting with combat level 40 raid, to help newer players progress; as the combat level of raiders increases, so will the raid level)\n\n- world boss pings (discord)\n- free Forge service, you provide recipe and materials (legendary or below: Chilleane)\n- Meditation buff service, this is a timed buff so discord is required for coordination (Akazawa)\n- free Alchemy service, you provide materials (Chilleane - in progress)\n- free House guest service (Chilleane, Desskit - in progress)",
